# Copy to .env.local and fill in from the Supabase dashboard.
# .env.local is gitignored. Never put real values in this file.
#
#   SUPABASE_URL          Project Settings -> API -> Project URL
#   SUPABASE_ANON_KEY     Project Settings -> API -> anon / public
#   SUPABASE_SERVICE_KEY  Project Settings -> API -> service_role  (secret: bypasses RLS)
#   SUPABASE_PROJECT_REF  Project Settings -> General -> Reference ID
#
#   DATABASE_URL          Connect (top bar) -> Session pooler -> URI, password filled in.
#                         Required by tools/sql.mjs and the grant tests; the "direct
#                         connection" host on the same dialog is IPv6-only and unreachable
#                         from most home connections, so take the pooler URI, not that one.
#   SUPABASE_ACCESS_TOKEN Account -> Access Tokens -> Generate new token (personal, spans
#                         every project). Used by the Supabase CLI.

SUPABASE_URL=
SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
SUPABASE_SERVICE_KEY=
SUPABASE_PROJECT_REF=
DATABASE_URL=
SUPABASE_ACCESS_TOKEN=
